   "text": "Server-side fallbacks (\"default\") are Claude API only. On Bedrock, use the Anthropic SDK refusal-fallback middleware or retry on another model yourself.\nSome categories have a recommended fallback model; others don't, and the refusal stands. Reset the conversation before you retry.",
